{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"screen\":\"关系也许会改变\",\"source\":\"明白有些话一旦说出口，关系就会改变\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿是明确认为说出口就会改变关系，屏幕稿改成了不确定的可能性。\"},{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"screen\":\"脚刚踏上小船，木板微晃，水波在脚下荡开，身体一瞬失重\",\"source\":\"也可以把开场听成一脚踏上小船……这里是刚刚踏上船板的感觉\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"定稿明确是听音乐时的船上想象，屏幕稿去掉听觉比喻的限定，并将它接入人物叙述，变成了人物实际踏上小船的场景。\"},{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"screen\":\"晚上独自回家\",\"source\":\"晚上回到家后\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿没有交代他是独自回家，屏幕稿增加了独自回去这一具体情境。\"},{\"sec\":\"S09\",\"screen\":\"两个人对视得呼吸都停了\",\"source\":\"整段像两个人对视到呼吸都停了\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿明确把两个人对视作为音乐带来的比喻画面，屏幕稿去掉了比喻标记，写成了两个人实际对视的场景。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"可他知道的事情已经太多\",\"source\":\"可你知道的事情已经太多了\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿是面向听者的旧房子比喻，屏幕稿把听者的经历和认知转移给主人公，变成了他已经知道太多事情的个人设定。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fac32a3a-8f26-430c-8dc2-644874586f8a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T052843509338Z", "elapsed_seconds": 238.046, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T05:32:41.597605+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "38636d1894f43814ef8796681f85b52e700add28424697639b75c64f1de1895c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "